          <![CDATA[TV game show recording]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <attribute name="Description" id="3085" net="1">
          <![CDATA[Recording a TV quiz show episode: contestant auditions and background checks with reserves, audience seating with a standby audience, contestant briefing and makeup and buzzer and scoreboard tests in parallel, the opening link with retakes, a buzzer round with unanswered and disputed answers ruled on by the adjudicator, a category round with steals, a tie-break, a final against the clock running in parallel with the questions and passes, jackpot or consolation prizes, pickup shots, audience release and compliance review in parallel, and the edit with broadcaster changes before transmission.]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <graphics count="0"/>
      </metadata>
